    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38134" root="لوش" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاشَ</span></b>  an abbreviation of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَاشَىْءَ</span> [<i>Nothing</i>]. It
is generally used coupled, or connected, with
a word of similar form; as in the saying
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">المَاشُ خَيْرٌ مِنْ لَاشَ</span>, which see in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">موش</span>.
(TA.)

